  "thag1.15:0.4": "5. Kuṇḍadhānattheragāthā 15. ",
  "thag1.15:1.1": "‘‘Pañca chinde pañca jahe, ",
  "thag1.15:1.2": "pañca cuttari bhāvaye; ",
  "thag1.15:1.3": "Pañcasaṅgātigo bhikkhu, ",
  "thag1.15:1.4": "oghatiṇṇoti vuccatī’’ti. … ",
  "thag1.15:1.5": "Kuṇḍadhāno thero…. "
}
